ings are kept", "The previous version was restored", "Update installed", "Downloading update", "Online Services", "nuubOS works fully offline. These services use the network only when you enable or start them.", "Only when you check", "Not in use", "Media", "Server address (http://server:8096)", "The media could not be played", "The server could not be reached", "Syncthing", "Keeps your saves in sync with your other devices. It is not a backup.", "This Console's ID", "Add it on your other device; it then appears here to accept", "Saves", "Save States", "Screenshots", "Wants to connect • press to accept", "Syncthing stopped unexpectedly", "Web", "Enter Address", "Web address or search", "Bookmarks", "History", "No bookmarks yet", "Add Bookmark", "Bookmark added", "Clear History", "Clear Browsing Data", "Removes cookies, site sign-ins and cached pages of this profile. Bookmarks are kept.", "The browser could not be started", "The browser closed unexpectedly", "WEB", "Go Back", "Go Forward", "Reload", "Zoom", "Quit Web", "Done", "D-pad moves between links, the left stick moves the pointer and the right stick scrolls.", "Keyboard", "Select a text field first", "Close the browser first", "Gaming", "GAMING", "LIBRARY", "Connect with WPS", "Cancel WPS", "Press the WPS button on your router…", "WPS timed out. Press the router button and try again.", "Several routers are in WPS mode. Try again in a few minutes.", "WPS failed: {0}", "WPS connection failed", "Leaves safe mode and restarts with your theme and settings.", "Connect to Wi-Fi or turn on Remote Services to get help remotely. Back returns here.", "Nothing played yet", "Your adventure log is a blank page. Pick a game and write chapter one!", "Fresh save file", "No games played so far. The controller is warmed up and ready.", "Player 1, ready?", "Your recently played games will appear here. Go make some history!", "Zero high scores… for now", "Start any game and it will be waiting right here for you.", "This shelf is g